<headroom-library version="1" id="crunch-hundred-watt" category="Crunch" order="10" instrument="guitar" style="Classic Rock">
  <description>A non-master-volume British 100-watt head turned up until the power section sings, into a greenback 4x12 in a small room. Chords stay clear, roll your guitar's volume back for clean, dig in for grind. No pedals.</description>
